DESCRIPTION:Come test out the latest Saucony gear and see what’s new in 
 the lineup before anyone else! This week at Run Club we have Nathan with S
 AUCONY joining us for a SHOE DEMO! Get excited to try the new Triumph 24\,
  Endorphin Pro 5\, and Guide 19! The route is about 3 miles\, starting fro
 m Sports Basement and looping through the Kawana Springs neighborhood. All
  levels are welcome — whether you're a sprinter\, a casual jogger\, or j
 ust getting started\, there's a spot for you. As usual\, stick around afte
 r to enjoy some refreshments and pizza and mingle with your fellow runners
 . Fun times guaranteed! Hope to see you there!
